   "reply": "Got it. I'll keep your grocery budget under $600 per month in any planning I do for you in this session. That works out to about $20 a day, or roughly $138 a week.\n\nI don't have a memory feature in this environment, so I can't carry this into future sessions. If you'd like it to persist, I can write it to a `CLAUDE.md` in your working directory. Or just tell me again next time.",
